# The Skullspore Nexus: Bot1 controls Grizzly Bears (2/2) and Elvish Mystic (1/1), so the Nexus costs {6}{G}{G} - {2} = {4}{G}{G} on turn 5 (three
# Moxen, two Forests and the Mystic pay it exactly). Bot2's Wrath of God on turn 6 destroys both together: "one or more nontoken creatures you control
# die" triggers once and creates one green Fungus Dinosaur token with base power and toughness each equal to the total power, 3/3. Bot2's second Wrath
# of God on turn 8 kills that token: it is a token, so it makes no trigger and no second token.

